        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Concurrent Utilization Review and Discharge Planning.\nCase management Medical, Alcohol, Drug and Psychiatric Medical Claims Review.\nMajor Medical ($50.00 deductible: 1 person; $100.00 deductible: maximum 2 persons).\nPsychiatric Rider.\nPrescription-Drug with contraceptives (Generic $1.00 co-pay --- Name Brand $5.00 co-pay).\nChiropractic ($100 per calendar year).",
